<% layout("/layouts/boilerplate.ejs") %>

<div class="privacy-container">

    <div class="privacy-header">
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p>Your privacy matters to us. Learn how Career Portal handles your information.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="privacy-content">

        <p>
            Welcome to <strong>Career Portal</strong>. This Privacy Policy
            explains what information may be collected when you use our
            platform, how it may be used, and the steps we take to help
            protect it.
        </p>

        <div class="privacy-section">
            <h3>1. Information We Collect</h3>
            <p>Depending on how you use Career Portal, we may collect the following information:</p>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Account information:</strong> Your username and authentication-related information.</li>
                <li><strong>Application information:</strong> Company names, job roles, application statuses, dates, deadlines, links, and notes you enter.</li>
                <li><strong>Contact information:</strong> Information you provide if you contact us.</li>
                <li><strong>Technical information:</strong> Limited information that may be processed by the hosting provider or browser to operate and secure the website.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="privacy-section">
            <h3>2. How We Use Your Information</h3>
            <p>Your information may be used to:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Create and manage your account.</li>
                <li>Allow you to record and track your career applications.</li>
                <li>Display your saved information and application status.</li>
                <li>Respond to your questions or requests.</li>
                <li>Maintain website security and troubleshoot technical problems.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="privacy-section">
            <h3>3. Account Security</h3>
            <p>
                Please keep your login credentials confidential. We aim to
                use reasonable security measures to protect account
                information, but no website or method of electronic storage
                can guarantee complete security.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="privacy-section">
            <h3>4. Cookies and Sessions</h3>
            <p>
                Career Portal may use session cookies to maintain your login
                session and support essential website functionality.
                These cookies help the website recognize your session as
                you navigate between pages.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="privacy-section">
            <h3>5. Data Storage</h3>
            <p>
                Information you submit may be stored in the database used
                by Career Portal to provide its features. Access to your
                application records should be restricted to your account
                where the relevant access controls are implemented.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="privacy-section">
            <h3>6. Sharing of Information</h3>
            <p>
                We do not intend to sell your personal information.
                Information may be processed by service providers that
                support website hosting, database storage, or other
                necessary technical operations. Information may also be
                disclosed when required by applicable law.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="privacy-section">
            <h3>7. Third-Party Links</h3>
            <p>
                Career Portal may contain links to external websites,
                including company career pages, internship listings,
                GitHub, Reddit, and other services. These websites have
                their own privacy policies, and we are not responsible
                for their privacy practices.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="privacy-section">
            <h3>8. Data Retention and Deletion</h3>
            <p>
                Information may be retained for as long as needed to
                provide the platform's features or meet applicable
                requirements. If you want your account or information
                deleted, contact us through our
                <a href="/contact">Contact Us</a> page.
                Deletion procedures depend on the features implemented
                by the platform.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="privacy-section">
            <h3>9. Children's Privacy</h3>
            <p>
                Career Portal is not intended to knowingly collect
                personal information from children in violation of
                applicable laws. If you believe personal information
                has been submitted improperly, please contact us.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="privacy-section">
            <h3>10. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h3>
            <p>
                We may update this Privacy Policy when the platform's
                features or data practices change. Any revised version
                will be published on this page with an updated date.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="privacy-section">
            <h3>11. Contact Us</h3>
            <p>
                If you have questions about this Privacy Policy or how
                your information is handled, please visit our
                <a href="/contact">Contact Us</a> page.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="privacy-updated">
            <strong>Last Updated:</strong> October 2026
            <p style="margin-top: 10px;">
                Thank you for trusting Career Portal.
            </p>
        </div>

    </div>
</div>